<title>PORTUGAL: Escudo nudges higher vs mark, tight range seen.</title>
<headline>Escudo nudges higher vs mark, tight range seen.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The escudo was trading slightly firmer against the mark on Friday, following in the wake of the Spanish peseta and the French franc.</p>
<p>The currency was at 100.81/84 to the mark against its 100.97/00 close on Thursday. Traders predicted a quiet session with the cross moving within a narrow 100.80-95 range.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
